<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>직원 정보 등록</title>
  <style>
    .onboard-page { width: min(100% - 32px, 1020px); margin: 32px auto 64px; }
    .onboard-intro { margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .onboard-intro h1 { font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 750; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #14243c; }
    .onboard-intro p { color: #64748b; margin: 0; }
    .onboard-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(15, 23, 42, .05); margin-bottom: 18px; overflow: hidden; }
    .onboard-card-head { padding: 19px 22px 0; }
    .onboard-card-head h2 { font-size: 1.08rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 5px; color: #14243c; }
    .onboard-card-head p { font-size: .87rem; color: #64748b; margin: 0; }
    .onboard-fields { padding: 20px 22px 24px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 18px 20px; }
    .onboard-field label { display: block; margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: .87rem; font-weight: 650; color: #334155; }
    .onboard-field .form-control, .onboard-field .form-select { min-height: 42px; border-color: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; font-size: .95rem; }
    .onboard-field .form-control:focus, .onboard-field .form-select:focus { border-color: #2563eb; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, .12); }
    .onboard-field .form-control[readonly] { background: #f8fafc; color: #475569; }
    .onboard-field small { display: block; color: #64748b; font-size: .78rem; margin-top: 6px; }
    .onboard-required { color: #dc2626; }
    .onboard-wide { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .onboard-details summary { list-style: none; cursor: pointer; padding: 19px 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #14243c; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
    .onboard-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .onboard-details summary::after { content: "열기"; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 550; font-size: .83rem; }
    .onboard-details[open] summary::after { content: "닫기"; }
    .onboard-details .onboard-fields { padding-top: 4px; }
    .onboard-actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .onboard-actions .btn { min-width: 110px; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; }
    .onboard-note { padding: 15px 18px; border: 1px solid #dbeafe; border-radius: 9px; background: #eff6ff; color: #1e3a5f; font-size: .86rem; }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .onboard-page { margin: 20px auto 48px; }
      .onboard-fields { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 18px; }
      .onboard-wide { grid-column: auto; }
      .onboard-card-head { padding: 18px 18px 0; }
      .onboard-intro h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; }
      .onboard-actions { justify-content: stretch; }
      .onboard-actions .btn { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('header') %>
  <main class="onboard-page">
    <div class="onboard-intro">
      <h1>직원 정보 등록</h1>
      <p>입사가 확정된 직원의 업무 정보를 등록합니다. <span class="onboard-required">*</span> 표시는 필수 항목입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <form id="employeeForm" action="/admin/employees/new" method="POST" enctype="multipart/form-data">
      <section class="onboard-card" aria-labelledby="onboardBasicTitle">
        <div class="onboard-card-head">
          <h2 id="onboardBasicTitle">기본 정보</h2>
          <p>조직 배치와 시스템 계정 연결에 필요한 항목입니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="onboard-fields">
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="employeeName">이름 <span class="onboard-required">*</span></label>
            <input class="form-control" id="employeeName" name="name" type="text" maxlength="40" required autocomplete="name">
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="hireDate">입사일 <span class="onboard-required">*</span></label>
            <input class="form-control" id="hireDate" name="hireDate" type="date" required>
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="orgType">소속 <span class="onboard-required">*</span></label>
            <select class="form-select" id="orgType" name="orgType" required>
              <option value="">소속 선택</option>
              <option value="본사">본사</option>
              <option value="지사">지사</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="department">부서 <span class="onboard-required">*</span></label>
            <select class="form-select" id="department" name="department" required>
              <option value="">부서 선택</option>
              <option value="보안1팀">보안1팀</option>
              <option value="보안2팀">보안2팀</option>
              <option value="보안3팀">보안3팀</option>
              <option value="관리팀">관리팀</option>
              <option value="인사팀">인사팀</option>
              <option value="영업팀">영업팀</option>
              <option value="지원팀">지원팀</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="position">직급</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="position" name="position">
              <option value="">선택 안 함</option>
              <option value="인턴">인턴</option>
              <option value="사원">사원</option>
              <option value="주임">주임</option>
              <option value="대리">대리</option>
              <option value="과장">과장</option>
              <option value="차장">차장</option>
              <option value="팀장">팀장</option>
              <option value="실장">실장</option>
              <option value="임원">임원</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="employmentType">고용형태</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="employmentType" name="employmentType">
              <option value="">선택 안 함</option>
              <option value="정규직">정규직</option>
              <option value="파견직">파견직</option>
              <option value="계약직">계약직</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="userId">연결 사용자 <span class="onboard-required">*</span></label>
            <select class="form-select" id="userId" name="userId" required>
              <option value="">사용자 계정 선택</option>
              <% users.forEach(function(user) { %>
                <option value="<%= user._id %>" data-email="<%= user.email %>"><%= user.username %> (<%= user.email %>)</option>
              <% }); %>
            </select>
            <small>먼저 직원의 로그인 계정을 생성해야 합니다.</small>
            <% if (!users.length) { %><small>연결할 수 있는 계정이 없습니다. 새 사용자 계정을 만든 뒤 등록하세요.</small><% } %>
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="accountEmail">이메일</label>
            <input class="form-control" id="accountEmail" type="email" placeholder="계정을 선택하면 표시됩니다" readonly>
            <small>연결한 사용자 계정의 이메일이 직원 정보에도 저장됩니다.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <details class="onboard-card onboard-details">
        <summary>연락 정보 <span class="visually-hidden">선택 입력</span></summary>
        <div class="onboard-fields">
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="mobile">휴대폰</label>
            <input class="form-control" id="mobile" name="mobile" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="30" placeholder="010-1234-5678">
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field">
            <label for="emergencyContact">비상연락처</label>
            <input class="form-control" id="emergencyContact" name="emergencyContact" type="tel" maxlength="30" placeholder="비상 시 연락 가능한 번호">
          </div>
          <div class="onboard-field onboard-wide">
            <label for="address">주소</label>
            <input class="form-control" id="address" name="address" type="text" autocomplete="street-address" maxlength="200" placeholder="주소를 입력하세요">
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="onboard-card onboard-details">
        <summary>병역사항 <span class="visually-hidden">선택 입력</span></summary>
        <div class="onboard-fields">
          <div class="onboard-field"><label for="militaryBranch">군별</label><input class="form-control" id="militaryBranch" name="militaryBranch" type="text" maxlength="50" placeholder="예: 육군"></div>
          <div class="onboard-field"><label for="militaryRank">계급</label><input class="form-control" id="militaryRank" name="militaryRank" type="text" maxlength="50" placeholder="예: 병장"></div>
          <div class="onboard-field"><label for="militaryNumber">군번</label><input class="form-control" id="militaryNumber" name="militaryNumber" type="text" maxlength="50"></div>
          <div class="onboard-field"><label for="militaryServicePeriod">복무기간</label><input class="form-control" id="militaryServicePeriod" name="militaryServicePeriod" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="예: 2020.01 ~ 2021.12"></div>
          <div class="onboard-field onboard-wide"><label for="militaryExemptionReason">미필·면제 사유</label><input class="form-control" id="militaryExemptionReason" name="militaryExemptionReason" type="text" maxlength="200"></div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="onboard-card onboard-details">
        <summary>경력사항 및 특이사항 <span class="visually-hidden">선택 입력</span></summary>
        <div class="onboard-fields">
          <div class="onboard-field onboard-wide"><label for="career">경력사항</label><textarea class="form-control" id="career" name="career" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="업무와 관련된 경력을 입력하세요"></textarea></div>
          <div class="onboard-field onboard-wide"><label for="specialNotes">특이사항</label><textarea class="form-control" id="specialNotes" name="specialNotes" rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="업무상 필요한 사항만 입력하세요"></textarea></div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="onboard-card onboard-details">
        <summary>프로필 사진 <span class="visually-hidden">선택 입력</span></summary>
        <div class="onboard-fields">
          <div class="onboard-field onboard-wide">
            <label for="profileImage">사진 파일</label>
            <input class="form-control" id="profileImage" name="profileImage" type="file" accept=".jpg,.jpeg,.png,.gif,image/jpeg,image/png,image/gif">
            <small>업무상 사진이 필요한 경우에만 첨부하세요. JPG, PNG, GIF 형식을 지원합니다.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
      <div class="onboard-note">
        유니폼 사이즈와 지급 정보는 직원 등록 후 유니폼관리에서 입력합니다. 급여계좌 등 급여 정보는 이 화면에서 수집하지 않습니다.
      </div>
      <div class="onboard-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="/employees">취소</a>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">직원 등록</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </main>
  <%- include('footer') %>
  <script>
    const accountSelect = document.getElementById('userId');
    const accountEmail = document.getElementById('accountEmail');
    function syncAccountEmail() {
      accountEmail.value = accountSelect.selectedOptions[0]?.dataset.email || '';
    }
    accountSelect.addEventListener('change', syncAccountEmail);
    syncAccountEmail();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
